+|---|---|---|---|
+| B1 | **A failed sell-review launch still counts as a fired alert.** When a trailing alert breaches and claire-api is down, slow (10 s timeout) or returns an error, `start_sell_review` swallows the failure and returns `None`; the watcher then records the fire anyway. No review is created, nothing is logged, one of the day's fires is used up and the next alert needs a further 3% fall. | `app/dashboards.py:3425-3436`, `app/watcher.py:268-273` | [V] |
